# Two trees must reach every checkout byte-for-byte, so line-ending
# conversion is off for them. Without this, Git for Windows' default
# `core.autocrlf=true` rewrites them at checkout: the fuzz seeds stop
# being the bytes that were fed to the parser, and every vendored spec
# digest mismatches, failing `cargo xtask sync-protocol-spec --check` on
# Windows with nothing a contributor can do about it locally.
protocol-spec/** -text
crates/playwright/fuzz/seeds/** -text
